WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 32 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.720
How is this possible? He looks like a god.

2
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.240
I was meant to be the one standing beside him.

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.280
It's a parlor trick, Beatrix! Don't you dare buy it!

4
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.120
Uh, Dragon God, I uh, I swear I didn't mean to be half naked in such a sacred place.

5
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.240
Could everyone maybe look at your boots for a second?

6
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.360
Molten gold scales. Holy fire on the wings.

7
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.390
Everything the scrolls promised. Standing right there.

8
00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.110
With all the 12 runes awakened and the Sovereign Dragon by his side,

9
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.550
there is no argument left to have. Aris is the Dragon God's chosen!

10
00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:38.430
Whoa, whoa, whoa, Duke Valman, hit the brakes! I'm a nobody! A floor sweater!

11
00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.470
And this little guy? He couldn't fly to save his life yesterday.

12
00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.470
There's got to be another explanation.

13
00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:50.660
I was blind, my lord. Blind and cruel.

14
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:55.860
And I cannot carry this Kodak a moment longer. Please, take it.
